# Twin Wireless phone agent — .gitignore
#
# Added 2026-09-14. THIS REPO IS PUBLIC and had no .gitignore. The app reads
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN and OWNER_PHONE from the environment, so
# a local .env is the obvious way to run it — and there was nothing to stop that
# file being committed.

# --- credentials ------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*token*.json
*secret*
credentials*

# --- customer data / PII ----------------------------------------------------
*.csv
exports/
*customer*
bookings/

# --- runtime noise ----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
